# Investigation History scope

- In **Codebase Audit** mode (`mode === 'audit'`), Investigation History shows **only** past codebase audits from ZIP uploads and GitHub repo ingest — never runtime debugging sessions.
- In **Runtime Debugging** mode, History shows runtime sessions only.
- Do **not** show the All / Runtime Debugging / Codebase Audit filter tabs beside the search box; mode already scopes the list.
- Keep table chrome (headers); empty state when no matching past scans/sessions.
